{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RUN YOUR OWN PIZZARIA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things get hectic fast in your cozy pizza shop! Take orders, serve customers, clean tables, and keep the kitchen under control. Start small \u2014 grow big. Can you keep up when the pressure\u2019s on?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/45cc55b2f353f073e26579eddd66486d.poster.avif?t=1754425302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/45cc55b2f353f073e26579eddd66486d.webm?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/45cc55b2f353f073e26579eddd66486d.mp4?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SHAPE YOUR STRATEGY W\u0130TH CARDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your deck with 35+ gameplay-changing cards that spice things up in every round. Some cards make your life easier\u2026 others? Pure mayhem. It\u2019s up to you how wild you want your shift to get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/bf09fbf0cb266f7458183a81a5c1172d.poster.avif?t=1754425302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/bf09fbf0cb266f7458183a81a5c1172d.webm?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/bf09fbf0cb266f7458183a81a5c1172d.mp4?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DIFFERENT CHEFS, DIFFERENT PLAYSTYLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a cast of quirky chefs, each with their own unique perks. Speed, efficiency, customer handling \u2014 every character brings something new to the table. Pick your favorite, or switch things up each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/67ff58a4dfc94040171b3330ac2704a5.poster.avif?t=1754425302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/67ff58a4dfc94040171b3330ac2704a5.webm?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/67ff58a4dfc94040171b3330ac2704a5.mp4?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UPGRADE AND EXPAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your earnings to buy new equipment and improve your restaurant. Each item can unlock fresh mechanics or boost your performance. Upgrade smart, and turn your pizza place into a culinary powerhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/93fe06de2fd191e53382575a633f1c87.poster.avif?t=1754425302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/93fe06de2fd191e53382575a633f1c87.webm?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/93fe06de2fd191e53382575a633f1c87.mp4?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VARIETY OF LOCATIONS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every restaurant has its own layout, flow, and vibe. From tight kitchens to wide open chaos, each place challenges your multitasking skills in a new way. Adapt, adjust, and make it work \u2014 no matter where you\u2019re tossed in.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892550?t=1754425302","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/bb5dcbf2bd6270664b719260bdd25e62065718be/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754425302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/01f17e9fafcbd9b2d38e99fd6afe998e99d919ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754425302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/01f17e9fafcbd9b2d38e99fd6afe998e99d919ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754425302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RUN YOUR OWN PIZZARIA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things get hectic fast in your cozy pizza shop! Take orders, serve customers, clean tables, and keep the kitchen under control. Start small \u2014 grow big. Can you keep up when the pressure\u2019s on?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/45cc55b2f353f073e26579eddd66486d.poster.avif?t=1754425302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/45cc55b2f353f073e26579eddd66486d.webm?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/45cc55b2f353f073e26579eddd66486d.mp4?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SHAPE YOUR STRATEGY W\u0130TH CARDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your deck with 35+ gameplay-changing cards that spice things up in every round. Some cards make your life easier\u2026 others? Pure mayhem. It\u2019s up to you how wild you want your shift to get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/bf09fbf0cb266f7458183a81a5c1172d.poster.avif?t=1754425302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/bf09fbf0cb266f7458183a81a5c1172d.webm?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/bf09fbf0cb266f7458183a81a5c1172d.mp4?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DIFFERENT CHEFS, DIFFERENT PLAYSTYLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a cast of quirky chefs, each with their own unique perks. Speed, efficiency, customer handling \u2014 every character brings something new to the table. Pick your favorite, or switch things up each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/67ff58a4dfc94040171b3330ac2704a5.poster.avif?t=1754425302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/67ff58a4dfc94040171b3330ac2704a5.webm?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/67ff58a4dfc94040171b3330ac2704a5.mp4?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UPGRADE AND EXPAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your earnings to buy new equipment and improve your restaurant. Each item can unlock fresh mechanics or boost your performance. Upgrade smart, and turn your pizza place into a culinary powerhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/93fe06de2fd191e53382575a633f1c87.poster.avif?t=1754425302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/93fe06de2fd191e53382575a633f1c87.webm?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/extras/93fe06de2fd191e53382575a633f1c87.mp4?t=1754425302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VARIETY OF LOCATIONS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every restaurant has its own layout, flow, and vibe. From tight kitchens to wide open chaos, each place challenges your multitasking skills in a new way. Adapt, adjust, and make it work \u2014 no matter where you\u2019re tossed in.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Duigrind"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892550/1282ec83c6b8f6fd65d2632fa2d439819185617d/header.jpg?t=1754425302","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257174603,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174603/movie480.mp4?t=1754425301","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174603/movie_max.mp4?t=1754425301"},"name":"Cinematic Gameplay Showcase","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174603/ec7cb1c0a8a9aab735b806f1f724055cc2dd257f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754425301","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174603/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754425301","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store